# 2. Trong mỗi Scope

Ví dụ Scope_CreateContract

## Filter Failed Action

From:

```text
 result('Scope_CreateContract')
 ```

Condition:

```text
 item()?['status']
 is equal to
 Failed
 ```

---

## Append to array variable

Run After:

```text
 Has Failed
 Has Timed Out
 ```

Value:

```json
 {
 "Scope": "Scope_CreateContract",
 "Action": "@{first(body('Filter_Failed_Action_CreateContract'))?['name']}",
 "Code": "@{first(body('Filter_Failed_Action_CreateContract'))?['error']?['code']}",
 "Message": "@{first(body('Filter_Failed_Action_CreateContract'))?['error']?['message']}",
 "Time": "@{utcNow()}"
 }
 ```

